# This add-on repo is edited on Windows (core.autocrlf=true) but every script and
# config here runs on Linux/Alpine inside Docker. CRLF line endings break the bash
# interpreter (\r in the shebang and after every command) and corrupt the
# heredoc-generated config.ini (e.g. "MQTTPort=1883\r" -> int() ValueError, the
# exact crash class the 0.1.6 fix addresses). Force LF on checkout for all text
# files so even a Windows working tree builds correct Linux images.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicit LF for the files executed inside the container (belt-and-suspenders).
*.sh         text eol=lf
Dockerfile*  text eol=lf
*.yaml       text eol=lf
*.yml        text eol=lf
*.json       text eol=lf
*.go         text eol=lf
go.mod       text eol=lf
go.sum       text eol=lf

# Common binaries — never normalize (safety net if any get added later).
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.zip  binary
*.gz   binary
*.tar  binary
*.pdf  binary
